I remember, a very long time ago, back when I first started playing
Nethack, looking at some documenation contained in the distribution,
and encountering a strangely-written text file that, among other
things, said that the invocation necessary to enter Explore Mode was
written in the "Man Page of Doom."

Lately I've been curious about that file.  I remember it contained
some documentation for the overlay manager, and was written by one of
the old DOS overlay guys, Stephen Spackman.

However, searching for "Man Page of Doom" (a phrase that should go on
a T-shirt in my opinion) on both Google and Window Live Search brings
up zero hits.  I have downloaded, from Ali's site, the source for
every Nethack version from 2.3e through 3.1.3, and many of the major
versions after that, but apparently the phrase isn't in any of the
files in any of them.

Does anyone else remember the file I'm talking about?

